WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.660
Hi, I'm Eric Voss

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:03.500
and The Matrix, the Wachowski cyberpunk masterpiece,

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.220
has for the past 20 yrs inspired a revolution

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:09.220
in the philosophy and the aesthetic of Hollywood films

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.220
and we mainly go to Blue Ray of every annoying

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.500
college roommate ever.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.500
And AS one of those annoying college roommates-

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.500
myself I decided to take a break from the usual deep

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.500
dives into superheroes, dragons and droids

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.500
as philosophical many of them are,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.580
to examine The Matrix scene by scene.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.860
To explore it's influences, how IT influenced nearly

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.620
everything that came after it and all the hidden

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.980
visual secrets in this movie that you might have missed

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:33.240
the first your friend's older brother who wore

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.040
sunglasses a lot showed it to you.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.040
The film opens from the point of view of

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.040
the matrix itself.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.040
In the form of this raining green code. The color green

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.040
was chosen to reflect the green

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.040
tint of early monochrome computer monitors and

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.040
and throughout this movie the color green filters

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:50.200
every scene that takes place inside the matrix. In order

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.100
to show it's artificiality compared to the REAL world

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.300
which is tinted in the color blue. This imagery was

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.980
inspired by the opening credits of the famous 1995

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:00.560
anime Ghost In The Shell.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.560
A HUGELY influential manga and film series,

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:05.560
Ghost In The Shell is set in the future where humans

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:08.580
are cybernetically enhanced and their brains can be hacked.

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:10.580
It explores the philosophy of artificial intelligence

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.580
and detached identity.

